			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 761840101,
					"content": "喲，真是新奇。想不到我還有一天能被邀請參加桑多涅妳的茶會。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840102,
					"content": "要是你的茶會禮儀好一些的話，我以前說不定還會考慮考慮多邀請你幾次。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840103,
					"content": "同意。而且最好不要每次都提出要和我們當中的人比試一番。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840104,
					"content": "妳們怎麼和我家裡的哥哥姐姐一樣，老這麼說我。沒辦法，以前在野外接受師父訓練的時候，不太注意這些。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840105,
					"content": "算了，能這麼聚在一起的機會也不多，還是安心享受當下的時光吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840106,
					"content": "哦？這就是妳的最新機器？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840107,
					"content": "她叫法潔歐。全功能通用型自動機關。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840108,
					"content": "這麼看來，普隆尼亞那個大傢伙是真的無法被修復了嗎…我很遺憾，桑多涅。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840109,
					"content": "沒事的，我…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840110,
					"content": "我很遺憾沒能和他打上一場。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840111,
					"content": "我就知道…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840112,
					"content": "那個大傢伙看起來真的很強，法潔歐看起來…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840113,
					"content": "…你是想說她看起來很弱嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840114,
					"content": "呃…哈哈，沒有沒有。只是，看起來沒普隆尼亞那個大傢伙那麼強而已。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840115,
					"content": "嘖，普隆尼亞是算術機械，他的戰鬥能力是我在不影響他算力的基礎上新增的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840116,
					"content": "但法潔歐無需處理複雜的術式，換言之，她的所有算力，都能夠用於處理戰鬥模組。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840117,
					"content": "也就是…比普隆尼亞更厲害的意思？真的假的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840118,
					"content": "我看你是真的想開開眼界是吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840119,
					"content": "先說好，打壞了我可不付維修費。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840120,
					"content": "我可不付醫藥費。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840121,
					"content": "（唉…果然還是發展成這樣了。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840122,
					"content": "（嚼嚼…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				}
			]
		},
